[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0743","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0743.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1021","title":"Alt-N MDaemon WebConfig 堆溢出远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Alt-N MDaemon 3.1.1 及更早版本的 WebConfig 组件中存在堆溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送超长 URL 触发该漏洞，导致服务拒绝，甚至可能在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 MDaemon 3.1.1 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1021"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59.267","remediation":"立即升级 Alt-N MDaemon 至 3.1.2 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，在防火墙或路由器层面限制对 WebConfig 服务端口（默认 3000）的远程访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96925269716274&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1689","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5250","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20225","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1021.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1021","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1021.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1021.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9vr9-vjm6-4vpp/GHSA-9vr9-vjm6-4vpp.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1021.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--594ad75d-f1c8-40a9-a1d8-7652cfa752cc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/cee5a3b524678beb8613152453ffdb7e3eac41b4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0743.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0742","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0742.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1016","title":"SuSE Linux Apache httpd 默认配置信息泄露漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 6.3/6.4 中 Apache HTTP Server 的默认配置文件 httpd.conf 将 /usr/doc 目录设为别名映射，导致远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 请求访问 /doc/packages 路径，直接读取系统已安装软件的文档及配置信息，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 SuSE Linux 6.3/6.4 版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。建议修改 Apache 配置移除该别名映射或限制访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1016"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:58.657","remediation":"编辑 Apache 配置文件 httpd.conf，删除或注释掉 `Alias /doc/packages /usr/doc` 行，或添加 `<Directory /usr/doc>` 权限限制块拒绝外部访问。同时建议升级到 SuSE 7.0 或更高版本，该版本已默认移除该别名配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/84360","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1707","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5276","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20236","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1016.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1016","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1016.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1016.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-68gh-xx2q-59p5/GHSA-68gh-xx2q-59p5.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/doc_package_browseable.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1016.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--43065014-4534-4594-919f-a92669d51663.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0742.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0740","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0740.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1014","title":"SCO Unixware SCOhelp HTTP Server 格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SCO Unixware 7.0 自带的 SCOhelp HTTP 服务器中 search97.cgi CGI 脚本存在格式字符串漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向 queryText 参数传入特制的格式字符串标记（如 %s、%n），即可触发该漏洞，导致攻击者能够在目标系统上执行任意命令。由于该服务通常以高权限运行，成功利用可造成服务器完全失陷，危害严重。该漏洞影响 SCO Unixware 7.0 版本。目前厂商已停止支持，建议用户升级至受支持的操作系统或迁移至替代方案。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1014"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:58.420","remediation":"立即停止使用 SCOhelp HTTP 服务，删除或移走 search97.cgi 脚本以防止远程利用。如业务必需该服务，建议升级到 SCO 官方发布的安全补丁版本，并在 Web 服务器层面限制对 search97.cgi 的访问来源 IP。由于 Unixware 7.0 已停止支持，强烈建议迁移至受支持的操作系统。同时，在防火墙上封禁对该服务的 80/443 端口外部访问，减少暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0325.html","http://www.osvdb.org/3240","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1717","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5291","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20242","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1014.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1014","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1014.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1014.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m5qj-69g5-cc43/GHSA-m5qj-69g5-cc43.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1014.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7693e460-1e36-4451-a8fc-f4e0d202ea61.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--7693e460-1e36-4451-a8fc-f4e0d202ea61.owl","https://github.com/mtesauro/legacy-owasp-wte/blob/5e5e965cba8579237e955817f807a10bd0cff59c/conversion/spikeproxy/contents/opt/owasp/spikeproxy/scan_database.db"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0740.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0738","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0738.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1009","title":"Red Hat dump 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 6.2 中 dump 工具（0.4b15 版本）存在本地权限提升漏洞。dump 程序盲目信任 RSH 环境变量所指定的路径，本地攻击者可通过将 RSH 环境变量修改为指向恶意木马程序，使 dump 以 root 权限执行该木马，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞需要本地访问权限，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1009"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:57.790","remediation":"升级 dump 工具至 0.4b16 或更高版本，该版本不再信任 RSH 环境变量路径。对于 Red Hat Linux 6.2 系统，建议升级至 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 3 或更高版本（已内置修复）。临时缓解措施可在运行 dump 前执行 `unset RSH` 清除环境变量，或通过 `export RSH=/bin/true` 覆盖为安全路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0438.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1871","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5437","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/193","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1009.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1009","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1009.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1009.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jph8-qvmw-2p95/GHSA-jph8-qvmw-2p95.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1009.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1871/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4eda469e-6f68-4b3d-b3cd-3fc024fc2504.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/cee5a3b524678beb8613152453ffdb7e3eac41b4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0738.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0734","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0734.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1005","title":"eXtropia WebStore 目录遍历漏洞","description":"eXtropia WebStore 1.0 及 2.0 版本的 html_web_store.cgi 和 web_store.cgi CGI 程序存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 page 参数提交包含 `../` 的恶意请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，如配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1005"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:57.310","remediation":"在 html_web_store.cgi 和 web_store.cgi 中对 page 参数做输入过滤，移除 `../` 等目录跳转序列，仅允许文件名在白名单内；同时在 Apache/Nginx 层面添加重写规则，拦截包含 `..` 的 URL 请求。如产品已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在更新支持的替代购物车系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/138495","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5347","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20279","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1005.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1005","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1005.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1005.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b9ffe771010e8d8280aae0f4179d692396788362/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vc22-9p26-2j2g/GHSA-vc22-9p26-2j2g.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/http_webstore.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1005.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/web-misc.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0734.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0732","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0732.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1002","title":"PragmaSys TelnetServer 2000 rexec 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Stalker CommuniGate Pro 3.3.2 的 POP3 服务守护进程在处理用户认证请求时存在信息泄露漏洞。当远程攻击者尝试登录时，该服务对无效用户名和无效密码返回不同的错误消息，导致攻击者可通过暴力枚举方式逐个探测有效邮箱地址。该漏洞可利用标准 POP3 客户端协议直接触发，无需任何认证权限，为后续针对特定用户的钓鱼或 SPAM 攻击提供目标信息。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1002"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:56.930","remediation":"建议立即升级至 PragmaSys TelnetServer 2000 最新补丁版本或更高版本。如厂商已停止支持，应停止使用该服务并迁移至活跃维护的替代方案（如 OpenSSH）。临时缓解措施可在防火墙或主机层面禁用 Telnet 及 rexec 服务端口（23/TCP），限制可访问 IP 范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/139523","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1792","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5363","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20175","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1002.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1002","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1002.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1002.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/923ff6a65023a656eae3176c80264be899b097da/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-95jw-8pwr-6x64/GHSA-95jw-8pwr-6x64.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1002.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f8ce999a-8401-4bec-8061-4c239353514a.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--f8ce999a-8401-4bec-8061-4c239353514a.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0732.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0731","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0731.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0998","title":"Debian top 格式字符串本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Debian 系统自带的 top 进程管理工具中存在格式字符串漏洞，本地攻击者可通过 top 的 kill 或 renice 功能提交特制的格式字符串参数触发该漏洞，导致攻击者能够以 root 权限执行任意代码或读取敏感内存信息。该漏洞影响 Debian 系统多个版本，攻击者需要具备本地用户权限才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0998"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:56.410","remediation":"立即升级 procps 包至已修复版本（Debian 3.0 woody 及以上），或应用 OpenBSD 官方补丁 028_format_strings.patch；FreeBSD 用户安装 FreeBSD-SA-00:62 安全公告对应补丁。临时缓解措施：移除 top 的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/top），限制本地非授信用户登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1895","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20378","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0998.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0998.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0998","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0998.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4cd396b19740b190e20a751f70ba95337b29a465/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-hxh8-j5q3-vm28/GHSA-hxh8-j5q3-vm28.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0998.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/truefinder/truefinder/blob/02568a5b230d1ea29e368cc8af0beaaf49c4f1ac/README.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1895/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0731.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0752","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0752.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1027","title":"Cisco PIX Firewall 5.2 PASV 模式 FTP 内部地址泄露漏洞","description":"Cisco Secure PIX Firewall 5.2(2) 在处理 FTP 被动模式（PASV）请求时，未将 PASV 响应报文中的内部私有 IP 地址转换为外部公网地址，导致远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务器发送大量 PASV 请求，从响应中获取 FTP 服务器的真实内部 IP 地址。该漏洞属于信息泄露类型，攻击者无需认证即可利用，泄露内网拓扑信息后可为进一步渗透攻击提供基础。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1027"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11","updated":"2000-12-11","remediation":"升级 Cisco PIX Firewall 至 5.2(4) 或更高版本，该版本已修复 PASV 响应中内部地址泄露问题。临时缓解措施：在 PIX 配置中启用 fixup protocol ftp strict 21 以严格校验 FTP PASV 命令，防止内部地址泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-1027","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97059440000367&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1877","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5646","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20369"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0752.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0749","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0749.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1025","title":"Unify eWave ServletExec 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Unify eWave ServletExec 3.0C及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。该ServletExec作为JSP/Java Servlet引擎插件，可集成于Apache、IIS、Netscape等Web服务器中。远程攻击者通过向目标服务器发送包含\"/servlet/ServletExec\"路径的HTTP请求，强制ServletExec引擎重新初始化并尝试在80端口绑定服务线程。由于Web服务器已占用该端口，导致java.net.BindException异常，造成ServletExec引擎异常终止，所有Java Servlet/JSP服务中断，需重启ServletExec服务方可恢复。该漏洞仅影响ServletExec组件，不影响Web服务器本身正常运行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1025"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级至 ServletExec 3.0E 或更高版本以彻底修复此漏洞。若无法立即升级，可在Web服务器（Apache/IIS/Netscape）配置中添加URL访问控制规则，拦截包含\"/servlet/ServletExec\"的请求路径作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97295224226042&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1868","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5435","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20336"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0749.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0749.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0749.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0736","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0736.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1008","title":"Palm OS 3.5.2 弱加密漏洞","description":"Palm OS 3.5.2 及更早版本使用弱加密算法（基于 XOR 的简单加密）存储用户密码，具有物理设备访问权限的攻击者可通过直接读取设备存储器中的加密密码数据，利用加密算法的弱点进行破解，从而获取解密后的密码并完全控制目标设备。该漏洞影响所有运行 Palm OS 3.5.2 及之前版本的 Palm 设备，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中等。由于攻击需要物理接触设备，实际利用场景受限，但设备丢失或被盗时会导致用户数据泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1008"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Palm OS 至 3.5.3 或更高版本，该版本采用更强的加密算法存储用户密码。对于无法升级的设备，可安装第三方加密应用对密码数据库进行二次加密保护，同时启用设备自动锁定功能并设置复杂密码以降低物理接触攻击风险。注意该漏洞于 2000 年公开，Palm 官方已停止支持相关产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.atstake.com/research/advisories/2000/a092600-1.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1715","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-1008"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0736.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0847","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0847.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1224","title":"Caucho Technology Resin 1.2 JSP 源代码泄漏漏洞","description":"Caucho Technology Resin 1.2（含更早版本）存在 JSP 源代码泄漏漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需在 HTTP 请求中访问 .jsp 文件并在文件名后附加特定字符序列（如 \"..\"、\"%2e..\"、\"%81\"、\"%82\" 等），即可绕过服务器解析机制，直接获取 JSP 文件的原始源代码。该漏洞导致 Web 应用的业务逻辑、数据库连接信息等敏感配置暴露，攻击者可据此深入分析系统弱点并发起进一步攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1224"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-11-23T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:25.010","remediation":"升级 Resin 至 1.2.1 及以上版本，该版本修复了文件名特殊字符处理缺陷，对 JSP 请求路径进行规范化验证。如无法升级，在 Apache 前端通过 mod_rewrite 添加规则，拒绝包含 \"..\"、\"%81\"、\"%82\" 等字符的 .jsp 请求；或在应用层增加过滤器，对 .jsp 请求的 URL 参数进行严格校验和编码过滤，阻止路径遍历字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97502269408279&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/146770","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1986","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5568","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20429","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6acfb9cecc7e37f5bf14164f693abec3417aeb06/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1224.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1224","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1224.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df56f4cca3ff4a807de70444fbb8d3458b1d46ca/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1224.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ca4032f687e5627fcf86913a0441b18137902527/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j52p-47c7-4w37/GHSA-j52p-47c7-4w37.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/Caucho%20Technology%20Resin%201.2%20JSP%E6%BA%90%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2000-1224).html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1224.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8ae3a77d-9c10-48ae-8cc1-c56b75270b2a.json","https://github.com/AbisaitReynaga/cibersecurity-tool/blob/c064a85fa0de959777ea70b4fa57445253263a01/web_application/data/cve_data/cve_list/Apache_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0847.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1686","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0843","title":"Linux PAM 认证模块 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"pam_smb 和 pam_ntdom 可插拔认证模块 (PAM) 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过使用过长的用户名进行登录尝试触发缓冲区溢出，进而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用 pam_smb 或 pam_ntdom PAM 模块进行认证的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 10.0 (CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H)，属于严重级别漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，仅需向认证服务发送超长用户名即可触发缓冲区溢出并执行任意代码，完全攻陷目标系统的机密性、完整性和可用性。建议升级至修复版本的 PAM 模块或禁用受影响的认证模块。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0843"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34.967","remediation":"建议立即升级 pam_smb 至 0.99.6.2 版本或更高版本（如 pam_smb 1.1.7+），或升级 pam_ntdom 至最新版本。若无法立即升级，可在 PAM 配置文件 /etc/pam.d/login 等中注释掉 pam_smb.so 和 pam_ntdom.so 模块行以禁用该模块，或在 /etc/pam.d/ 相关配置中限制用户名最大长度（如使用 pam_succeed_if.so user_len < 256 限制用户名长度）。同时建议在防火墙层面限制不必要的远程登录服务（如 SSH、Telnet）访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0073.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0114.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000911","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-047.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/adv8_draht_pam_smb_txt.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1666","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0843.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0843","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0843.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0843.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pp6c-mf5j-mr6w/GHSA-pp6c-mf5j-mr6w.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/pam_smb.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0843.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6e769140-7c23-4b16-a2f5-d47203c9679c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1685","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1685.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0841","title":"XMail XMail POP3 Server 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"XMail POP3 服务器 0.59 版本前存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过发送超长 APOP 命令触发栈溢出，实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 XMail POP3 服务器 0.59 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0（CVSS:AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），属严重级远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需向目标 POP3 服务发送精心构造的超长 APOP 命令即可触发缓冲区溢出，劫持程序控制流执行任意 shellcode，完全控制目标服务器。建议升级至 XMail 0.59 或更高版本修复该漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0841"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34.717","remediation":"建议立即升级 XMail POP3 服务器到 0.59 或更高版本，官方已在 0.59 版本修复该 APOP 缓冲区溢出漏洞。若无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制 POP3 服务（端口 110）仅允许受信任 IP 访问，或在 XMail 配置中禁用 APOP 认证功能作为临时缓解措施。建议同时监控 POP3 服务异常连接日志，及时发现异常 APOP 命令尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0001.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1652","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5191","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0841.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0841","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0841.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0841.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g9jh-g4m5-mh59/GHSA-g9jh-g4m5-mh59.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/X/xmail_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1652/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152800_152900.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/a385c4020f7ae284766597334fa1736540c56316/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-08xx/CVE-2000-0841.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1685.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1684","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1684.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0840","title":"XMail POP3 服务器 缓冲区溢出 远程代码执行 漏洞","description":"XMail POP3 服务器 0.59 版本之前存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于 POP3 服务在处理 USER 命令时未对用户名长度进行边界检查，导致远程未认证攻击者可通过发送超长的 USER 命令参数触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖返回地址实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 XMail 0.59 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重），攻击向量为网络远程、无需认证、低攻击复杂度，攻击者只需向目标 POP3 服务端口（默认 110 端口）发送超长用户名即可触发漏洞，成功利用可获得服务器最高权限执行任意代码。该漏洞于 2000 年 11 月 14 日披露，XMail 0.59 版本已修复该漏洞，建议升级至 0.59 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0840"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-11-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:34.590","remediation":"建议立即升级 XMail POP3 服务器至 0.59 版本或更高版本（官方下载地址：http://www.xmailserver.org/download.html）。升级前请备份配置文件和邮件数据。若无法立即升级，请在防火墙层面限制 POP3 端口（默认 110/tcp）仅允许可信 IP 访问，或临时停用 POP3 服务作为临时缓解措施。升级后请重启 XMail 服务并验证 POP3 服务正常运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0001.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1652","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5192","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0840.json",